## 4. Create & Manage a Custom Trip

### Create Trip
```
[My Trips Page]
  → Click "+ Create Trip"
  → Modal:
      Trip Title, Description
      Start Date, End Date
      Min Budget (₹), Max Budget (₹)
      Travelers, Trip Type (dropdown), Transport Mode (dropdown)
  → POST /api/trips
  → Trip appears in list
```

### Invite Members
```
[Trip Detail Page]
  → Members panel (right sidebar)
  → "Add Member by Email" input
  → Enter friend's email → click add button
  → POST /api/trips/{id}/members
  → Member added (shows name + email)
  → Member can now see trip & expenses in their account
```

### Start Trip
```
[Trip Detail Page]
  → "Start Trip" button
  → Status: PLANNING → ONGOING
```

