## 5. Expense Splitting (The Core Feature)

### Add Expense
```
[Trip Detail] → click "Expenses & Settlements"
[Expenses Page] → click "+ Add Expense"
  → Modal:
      Description (e.g. "Dinner at mountain café")
      Amount (₹)
      Category: FOOD / TRANSPORT / ACCOMMODATION / ACTIVITIES / MEDICAL / SHOPPING / MISCELLANEOUS
      Split Type: EQUAL
      Participants: select from trip members
  → POST /api/trips/{id}/expenses
  → Expense appears in list for ALL trip members
```

### View Expense List
```
[Expenses Tab]
  Each row: Category emoji, Description, "Paid by X", Split type, People count, Amount, Category badge
  → Delete button (for expense creator)
```

### View Balances
```
[Balances Tab]
  Per member card:
    Name
    "Gets back" (green) or "Owes" (red) indicator
    Paid: ₹XX,XXX
    Owes: ₹XX,XXX
    Net:  +₹X,XXX  or  -₹X,XXX
```

### Settle Up
```
[Settle Up Tab]
  Header: "Simplified Transactions"
          "Minimum payments to settle all debts in this trip"

  Each row: [Person A] → [Person B]  ₹Amount   [Mark Settled]

  → Click "Mark Settled"
  → PUT /api/trips/{id}/expenses/settle/{sid}
  → Row marked as settled
  → Pending Debts count decreases
```

