## Data Flow: Payment to Booking

```
User selects package + travelers
        │
        ▼
POST /api/payments/create-order
  → Razorpay SDK: orders.create({amount, currency: "INR"})
  → Returns: { orderId, amount, currency }
        │
        ▼
Razorpay Checkout Modal opens in browser
User enters card/UPI/netbanking details
        │
        ▼
Payment processed on Razorpay servers
Returns: { razorpay_payment_id, razorpay_order_id, razorpay_signature }
        │
        ▼
POST /api/payments/verify
  → HMAC-SHA256 signature verification
  → If valid: create Booking record (status=CONFIRMED)
              create Payment record (status=SUCCESS)
  → Returns: { bookingId, bookingNumber, status }
        │
        ▼
Frontend redirects to /bookings
User sees new confirmed booking
```

